      {
        "id": 91338,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-15T05:54:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>And note that if you're the guy that continuously bitches about various aspects of something and practically demands that stuff be changed (or says that it's stupid that things are this way in the first place), it's highly unlikely that anyone's going to listen to you and take your criticism on board.</p><p>If I whined constantly about how the game boxes so far suck because they aren't purple and called Adam an idiot for not making them purple and threaten to refuse to buy any future non-purple boxes and say that all the art on the cards that aren't purple is a huge mistake, I'd totally expect the guys to ignore me and make the next box green if green is the planned next box colour.</p><p>There's totally a difference between that and saying that you love a particular card because of its purpleness and that you'd like to see more purple in future, and maybe if the next box colour's not been decided yet they could you consider purple please? Option two might actually get me some purple.</p><p>Compare and contrast:</p><p>I can't believe there aren't more environments! I'm getting bored of these ones and require many more, it's a massive mistake if you don't cave in to my demands and that will make you bad at your job. But hey, you're bad at your job anyway because you didn't make more environments in the first place. Plus some of your heroes are crappy because they don't do exactly what I think they should do all the time. Give me more heroes!</p><p>Me and my friends are having great fun with this game and were wondering if there are any plans for new environments - we'd love to see some more generic ones if possible, like under the slide in a children's play park or a busy motorway or a completely mundane 50s-style diner which has run out of cheese for the cheeseburgers. And we never seem to be able to keep Ostrich Envelope Boy alive for longer than three turns, are we missing something? Could we please have more weasel-based villains?</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:16:56.456Z",
